# `git archive` substitutes `$Format:...$` placeholders only in files marked
# export-subst -- which is how the deployed relay learns which commit it was
# built from without a build step (see `lib/src/relay/build_info.dart` and
# the "Deploying the relay" section of README.md). Deployment here is
# `git archive` -> scp -> `systemctl restart`, so this substitution is the
# only moment anything knows the commit at all.
#
# Kept in `server/.gitattributes` rather than the repository root on purpose:
# attributes are read from the tree being archived, so a root-level file
# would be missed by an archive rooted at this directory, while this one
# applies either way.
lib/src/relay/build_info.dart export-subst
